<title>HUNGARY: FOTEX JAN-SEPT NET INCOME 374MLN FORINTS.</title>
<headline>FOTEX JAN-SEPT NET INCOME 374MLN FORINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending on September 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Jan-Sept 96	Jan-Sept 97</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	    512		  852</p>
<p>    Group net income		    374		  517</p>
<p>    Group profit before taxation</p>
<p>	 and minority interest	  553	vs	732</p>
<p>    Group minority interest	    97  loss vs     101 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		456	vs	631</p>
<p>    Group tax-payment		    82	vs	114</p>
<p>    Group sales			23,725	vs   22,865</p>
<p>NOTE - Fotex Rt is a retail chain with various fields of activity. The figures are consolidated, calculated according to International Accounting Standards. The 1996 figures are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
